{
    "title": "Fashion Designer: Super Tailor",
    "description": "Enter a virtual world of fashion fantasies made real, where fashion design and social connection mix like never before. Design outfits, dress up models and join a battle with designers from around the globe. Your new life as a fashion designer awaits!\r\n\r\n\u2728 EXPLORE THOUSANDS OF STYLISH PIECES \u2728\r\nDiscover thousands of stunning clothing items designed by a fantastic team of artists. From high-end fashion to street style, from elegant evening gowns to casual everyday wear, our clothing library has it all. You can choose from: \r\n- A wide range of tops, bottoms, dresses, outerwear, and accessories in various styles; \r\n- Traditional and modern designs from different countries and cultures; \r\n- Outfits for every occasion, from formal events to casual daily activities.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc57 DESIGN YOUR UNIQUE STYLE \ud83d\udc57\r\nDress up your models in thousands of stunning clothing and accessory items. Complete the look with chic hairstyles and makeup styles.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 CREATE CUSTOM OUTFITS \ud83c\udfa8\r\nCustomize your clothes with a vast variety of accessories, patterns, lace, decals, and colors to create one-of-a-kind outfits. Transform simple clothes into elegant and stunning masterpieces.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 COMPETE IN GLOBAL FASHION BATTLES \ud83c\udfc6\r\nJoin fashion stylists from around the world in exciting themed challenges. Showcase your skills and prove who truly deserves the title of ultimate fashion designer.\r\n\r\nDownload the ultimate\u00a0fashion design game\u00a0and become a renowned\u00a0fashion designer.\u00a0Dress up,\u00a0makeup, and\u00a0makeover\u00a0your way to the top of the\u00a0fashion\u00a0world!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enter a virtual world of fashion fantasies made real, where fashion design and social connection mix like never before. Design outfits, dress up models and join a battle with designers from around the globe. Your new life as a fashion designer awaits!<br><br>\u2728 EXPLORE THOUSANDS OF STYLISH PIECES \u2728<br>Discover thousands of stunning clothing items designed by a fantastic team of artists. From high-end fashion to street style, from elegant evening gowns to casual everyday wear, our clothing library has it all. You can choose from: <br>- A wide range of tops, bottoms, dresses, outerwear, and accessories in various styles; <br>- Traditional and modern designs from different countries and cultures; <br>- Outfits for every occasion, from formal events to casual daily activities.<br><br>\ud83d\udc57 DESIGN YOUR UNIQUE STYLE \ud83d\udc57<br>Dress up your models in thousands of stunning clothing and accessory items. Complete the look with chic hairstyles and makeup styles.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 CREATE CUSTOM OUTFITS \ud83c\udfa8<br>Customize your clothes with a vast variety of accessories, patterns, lace, decals, and colors to create one-of-a-kind outfits. Transform simple clothes into elegant and stunning masterpieces.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 COMPETE IN GLOBAL FASHION BATTLES \ud83c\udfc6<br>Join fashion stylists from around the world in exciting themed challenges. Showcase your skills and prove who truly deserves the title of ultimate fashion designer.<br><br>Download the ultimate\u00a0fashion design game\u00a0and become a renowned\u00a0fashion designer.\u00a0Dress up,\u00a0makeup, and\u00a0makeover\u00a0your way to the top of the\u00a0fashion\u00a0world!",
